{"last_link_id": 117, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 108, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [270, 136], "pos": [1064.808349609375, 905.264404296875], "id": 95, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [104], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]\n那年春天我遇见了你\n潇湘馆外桃花正开得美丽\n你说我是顽石不懂情意\n却不知我心里早已为你痴迷\n你的眼泪像春雨洒落我心底\n每一滴都让我心疼不已\n我知道这份情不被世俗允许\n可我宁愿做那扑火的飞蛾\n\n[Chorus] (Strings subtly swell beneath the guitar)\n你说爱一个人是多么不容易\n尤其是在这大观园里\n我看着你流泪，看着你叹息\n却无能为力，只能在心里着急\n你说人生如戏，我们都是演员而已\n可我偏偏动了真情实意\n这份爱就像深埋地下的秘密\n见不得光，却在我心里疯长不息\n\n[Verse 2] (Music pulls back, voice more reflective)\n后来我又遇见了另一个你\n端庄贤淑，温柔又美丽\n你说金玉良缘是天经地义\n可我心里始终有个位置属于过去\n你的关心像暖阳照进我心底\n每一份都让我感激不已\n我知道这份情也是真心实意\n可我偏偏忘不了那个潇湘妃子\n\n[Chorus] (Emotion and musical intensity build)\n你说爱一个人是多么不容易\n尤其是在这大观园里\n我看着你流泪，看着你叹息\n却无能为力，只能在心里着急\n你说人生如戏，我们都是演员而已\n可我偏偏动了真情实意\n这份爱就像深埋地下的秘密\n见不得光，却在我心里疯长不息\n\n[Bridge] (Music becomes sparse and tense, voice pleading and raw)\n他们说我太傻太痴太执迷\n不懂什么叫做现实什么叫做放弃\n可我知道爱情不是买卖可以算计\n一旦动了心就身不由己\n我多想把你们两个人都好好珍惜\n可命运偏偏让我陷入这两难之地\n也许这就是人生，这就是天意\n有些爱注定要埋藏在心底\n\n[Guitar Interlude] (An emotional and melodic acoustic guitar solo)\n\n[Final Chorus] (Fullest arrangement, voice is powerful and broken)\n你说爱一个人是多么不容易\n尤其是在这大观园里\n我看着你流泪，看着你叹息\n却无能为力，只能在心里着急\n你说人生如戏，我们都是演员而已\n可我偏偏动了真情实意\n这份爱就像深埋地下的秘密\n见不得光，却在我心里疯长不息\n\n[Outro] (Music fades to solo guitar, voice is exhausted and whispery)\n如今繁华落尽，一切都成过去\n只剩下我一个人，在回忆里徘徊不已\n如果有来生，我愿做个平凡的人\n不再踏入这红楼梦里..."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [317.22955322265625, 787.3596801757812], "pos": [-306.2093200683594, 867.571044921875], "id": 85, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [106], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["A heart-wrenching mandopop ballad that perfectly captures the raw, conversational, and deeply emotional style of legendary songwriter Li Zongsheng. The entire song is performed by a single male vocalist with a distinctive, raspy, and world-weary voice, delivering the lines with a sense of spoken-word realism and suppressed pain. The arrangement is built around a central, intricate acoustic guitar pattern, complemented by a warm, melancholic bass line and subtle, atmospheric string pads that swell only in the chorus to emphasize the emotional peaks. The song tells a tragic story of a love triangle, filled with helplessness, forbidden desire, and ultimate regret."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [305.7560729980469, 164.18731689453125], "pos": [134.3555145263672, 1042.4832763671875], "id": 98, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#3f5159", "groupcolor